        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: உற்பத்தி",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "உற்பத்தி — uṟpatti — \"production; output\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்தத் தொழிற்சாலையில் உற்பத்தி இரண்டு மடங்கு அதிகரித்தது. intat toḻiṟcālaiyil uṟpatti iraṇṭu maṭaṅku atikarittatu. Production in this factory doubled."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With செய் (cey) it becomes a verb: உற்பத்தி (uṟpatti) செய், to produce."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "உற்பத்தி (uṟpatti) is borrowed from Sanskrit utpatti, \"origin, birth\", later also \"profit\" (CDIAL 1812). Tamil writes the cluster tp as ற்ப."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
